# The build context is only ever used for the dependency layer: the Dockerfile
# COPYs requirements files and ci/entrypoint.sh, nothing else. Source reaches the
# container by bind mount at run time, from a disposable worktree.
#
# So this file is aggressive on purpose. Sending data/ (hundreds of MB of packs)
# into the build context would make every image build slow for no benefit.

*
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!ci/requirements-ci.txt
!ci/entrypoint.sh
